# Component tests

Add process-level tests here for:

- the operational HTTP probes;
<!--#if exposure-->
- the registered business REST and GraphQL adapters;
<!--#endif-->
<!--#if messaging-->
- message handling, retention and recovery with RabbitMQ;
<!--#endif-->
<!--#if persistence-->
- committed PostgreSQL state of application-owned SQL;
<!--#endif-->
- bounded shutdown.

The uncached test-component target selects only this directory and has no
unit-test preload.
<!--#if persistence|messaging-->
Each live fixture must provision its own
<!--#if persistence-->
PostgreSQL database and runtime role,
<!--#endif-->
<!--#if messaging-->
broker and queues,
<!--#endif-->
assign unique ports, verify ownership before cleanup and close all processes
in finally.
<!--#else-->
This application needs no database or broker; assign unique ports and close all
processes in finally.
<!--#endif-->
Never target development or sibling infrastructure. No generic User/Wallet
environment is selected.
